---
/**
 * The note at the head of the homepage specimen (P15): what it is, that its Blog posts are
 * invented, and the way back. A note, not a heading: the page's one `<h1>` is the homepage's own.
 */
---

<aside class="home-specimen" role="note" data-home-specimen>
  <p>
    <strong>Development specimen, not a page of the website.</strong> This is the real homepage,
    drawn by the production components, with <em>synthetic</em> Blog posts in the updates section
    so you can see it populated. Nobody wrote those posts and they are published nowhere. A
    production build leaves this page out.
  </p>
  <p><a href="/">The real homepage</a></p>
</aside>

<style>
  .home-specimen {
    margin-block-end: var(--space-l);
    padding: var(--space-xs) var(--space-s);
    border: var(--border-width-hairline) dashed var(--color-folder-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    background-color: var(--color-surface-callout);
    font-family: var(--font-label);
    font-size: var(--font-size-sm);
  }

  .home-specimen p + p {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-2xs);
  }
</style>
